        <div class="text-left p-4 my-auto josefin-sans">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
            <p>The brands of Perdue Farms work with small family farmers and ranchers across the country, who carry on
                an
                agricultural tradition handed down from their parents and grandparents. Networks are comprised of cattle
                ranchers, sheep farmers, hog farmers and poultry farmers, who must follow a specific (and strict!) set
                of
                farming protocols to raise livestock for our brands.</p>
            <p>Here, we share more about their hard work, day-to-day farming life and challenges, plus efforts we are
                taking
                to support them and ensure that their families can farm for years to come.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
